  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“I like to put just a little more time into my blasts.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Must possess a composite blast which modifies and is treated as another blast.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use a composite blast to modify another blast (such as aetheric boost), you can apply substance infusions of the composite blast’s element (for example, a gravitic boost fire blast could use all void substance infusions in addition to those normally associated with fire blast).</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> When using a composite blast to modify another blast, the composite blast is treated as the modified blast, and as such is only associated with infusions normally associated with the modified blast.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
